{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"球谱"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"球谱"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<h3>作为一个元素生成的自由 $\\mathbb E_\\infty$-群</h3>\n<p>在 "},{"Local":{"url":"E∞-群","text":"$\\mathbb E_\\infty$-群"}},{"Plain":"与"},{"Local":{"url":"连合谱","text":"连合谱"}},{"Plain":"的等价\n$$\r\n\\Omega^\\infty \\colon \\mathsf{Sp}_{\\geq 0} \\overset{\\simeq}{\\longrightarrow} \\mathsf{Grp}_{\\mathbb E_\\infty}(\\mathsf{Ani})\r\n$$\n中, 球谱 $\\mathbb S \\in \\mathsf{Sp}_{\\geq 0}$ 是一个元素生成的"},{"Local":{"url":"自由-遗忘伴随","text":"自由"}},{"Plain":"的 "},{"Local":{"url":"E∞-群","text":"$\\mathbb E_\\infty$-群"}},{"Plain":"的对应物.</p>\n<p>一个元素生成的"},{"Local":{"url":"自由-遗忘伴随","text":"自由"}},{"Plain":"的 "},{"Local":{"url":"交换代数","text":"$\\mathbb E_\\infty$"}},{"Plain":"幺半群是有限集的生象 $\\mathsf{Fin}^\\simeq$ (即有限集范畴 $\\mathsf{Fin}$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"对象的生象","text":"对象的生象"}},{"Plain":"). 它可以写成无交并\n$$\r\n\\mathsf{Fin}^\\simeq = \\coprod_{n\\geq 0}B\\Sigma_n.\r\n$$\n其"},{"Local":{"url":"群化","text":"群化"}},{"Plain":"为 $\\Omega^\\infty \\mathbb S$.</p>\n"}]}}